<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Nonprofits for JCF Connectivity</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Nonprofits adding their voice, asking Jewish Communal Fund to allow ACH linkage from JCF to a nonprofit's Chariot deposit account for gift processing." />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/colors_and_type.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/site.css" />
</head>
<body>

  <div class="nav-bar">
    <div class="nav-wordmark">Nonprofits <span class="accent">for JCF Connectivity</span></div>
    <div class="nav-actions">
      <a href="/admin/login" class="btn btn-cream">Admin</a>
      <a href="/voices" class="btn btn-navy">See supporters</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-row">
    <div class="hero-photo">
      <img src="/img/hero.jpg" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'" />
      <div class="hero-scrim"></div>
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <h1>Faster, Easier Gift Processing With JCF. So Nonprofits Can Focus on Their Mission.</h1>
        <p>Jewish Communal Fund&rsquo;s donors already give generously to organizations like ours. We&rsquo;re asking JCF to let approved grants land directly in our Chariot deposit account &mdash; no more manual work on our end.</p>
        <div class="hero-badges">
          <span class="hero-badge">Started by nonprofits across the sector</span>
          <span class="hero-badge">September 2026</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="sign" class="sign-card">
      <div class="sign-stat-box">
        <div class="sign-stat-num-row">
          <div class="sign-stat-num"><%= counts.total_count %></div>
          <div class="sign-stat-label">nonprofits and growing</div>
        </div>
        <div class="avatar-stack">
          <div class="avatar-stack-inner">
            <% avatarChips.forEach(function(initial, i) { %>
              <div class="avatar-chip <%= i % 2 === 0 ? 'a' : 'b' %>"><%= initial %></div>
            <% }) %>
          </div>
          <div class="avatar-stack-caption"><%= avatarCaption %></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sign-divider"></div>

      <% if (!submitted) { %>
        <form method="POST" action="/sign" class="form-stack" id="sign-form">
          <% if (error) { %>
            <div class="error-banner"><%= error %></div>
          <% } %>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="nonprofit_name">Nonprofit name</label>
            <input type="text" id="nonprofit_name" name="nonprofit_name" placeholder="e.g. Masbia Soup Kitchen Network" value="<%= formData.nonprofit_name || '' %>" />
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="signer_name">Your name</label>
            <input type="text" id="signer_name" name="signer_name" placeholder="Jane Doe" value="<%= formData.signer_name || '' %>" />
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="signer_role">Your role</label>
            <input type="text" id="signer_role" name="signer_role" placeholder="Director of Development" value="<%= formData.signer_role || '' %>" />
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="why">Why does this matter to your nonprofit?</label>
            <textarea id="why" name="why" rows="5" placeholder="Tell JCF what ACH linkage would mean for your gift processing."><%= formData.why || '' %></textarea>
          </div>

          <label class="checkbox-row anon-row">
            <input type="checkbox" name="anonymous" id="anonymous" <%= formData.anonymous ? 'checked' : '' %> />
            <span>Submit anonymously <span class="muted">&mdash; we&rsquo;ll only show your comment</span></span>
          </label>

          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-glacier btn-block">Add my voice</button>
        </form>
      <% } else { %>
        <div class="thankyou">
          <div class="thankyou-check">&check;</div>
          <div class="thankyou-title">Thank you.</div>
          <p>Your voice has been added. It&rsquo;ll appear on the wall once reviewed.</p>
        </div>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="matters-card">
    <div class="matters-card-inner">
      <h2>Why this <span class="accent">matters.</span></h2>
      <p>Today, once a JCF grant is approved, nonprofits can&rsquo;t receive it electronically into their Chariot deposit account &mdash; it adds manual work to gift processing and financial reconciliation. One small change from JCF would fix that.</p>

      <div class="info-grid">
        <div class="info-card navy-top">
          <div class="eyebrow">For nonprofits</div>
          <h3>ACH linkage</h3>
          <p>Nonprofits should be able to choose to have their approved JCF funds deposited straight into their Chariot deposit account &mdash; just like any other bank account &mdash; once JCF has reviewed and approved the gift.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="voices-section" id="voices">
    <h2>Nonprofits are speaking up.</h2>
    <p class="subhead">What JCF&rsquo;s grant recipients are telling us this change would mean to them.</p>

    <% if (teaserSigners.length === 0) { %>
      <p class="subhead">Be the first to add your voice above.</p>
    <% } else { %>
      <div class="voice-grid">
        <% teaserSigners.forEach(function(s) { %>
          <div class="voice-card">
            <div class="voice-badges">
              <span class="badge badge-ach">ACH Linkage</span>
            </div>
            <p class="voice-quote">&ldquo;<%= s.blurb %>&rdquo;</p>
            <div class="voice-identity">
              <div class="voice-avatar"><%= s.initials %></div>
              <div>
                <div class="voice-name"><%= s.displayName %></div>
                <div class="voice-subtitle"><%= s.displaySubtitle %></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        <% }) %>

        <a href="#sign" class="voice-cta-tile">
          <div class="label">Add your voice</div>
          <div class="arrow">&#8593;</div>
        </a>
      </div>
    <% } %>

    <div class="view-all-link">
      <a href="/voices" class="btn btn-outline">View all supporter voices &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="site-footer">
    <div class="site-footer-inner">
      <div>
        <div class="site-footer-title">Nonprofits for JCF Connectivity</div>
        <div class="site-footer-desc">An informal coalition of nonprofits asking Jewish Communal Fund to accept Chariot Deposit Account ACH linkages.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="site-footer-partner">
        <span>In partnership with</span>
        <img src="/img/chariot-logo.svg" alt="Chariot" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
